# Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values

# Telegram Bot Integration
VITE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here
VITE_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_telegram_chat_id_here

# Notes:
# - DO NOT commit .env.local to git (it's in .gitignore)
# - For Netlify production: Set these variables in Netlify Dashboard
#   Settings → Environment → Environment variables
# - For local development: Copy this file to .env.local and add your values
